Cell["\<\
The causal hull of three events of the diamond lattice, the smallest convex \
set that contains them: the union of the diamonds between the comparable \
pairs. The two upper events are incomparable, so the hull has two arms.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"bc6d02eb-75a6-4433-8db9-af397e48535c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

